# Node / Vite app
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.local

# Training workspace — raw datasets, processed data, and trained model
# artifacts are never committed (see training/datasets/README.md). This
# also covers synthetic demo data from make_synthetic_sample.py — it's
# regenerated from a fixed seed, not hand-crafted, so it doesn't need to
# live in git either. These directories don't need to exist in git at
# all: every script that writes into them creates them on demand
# (Path(...).mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)).
training/data/raw/
training/data/processed/
training/models/
training/exports/**/model.json
*.csv
*.parquet
*.jsonl
*.ckpt
*.joblib
*.onnx
training/**/.venv/

# Evaluation reports ARE committed — they're small markdown files that
# document real, reproducible pipeline runs (see training/evaluation/).

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.log
